      <p>Some krewe members prefer to be picked up back at the den once they've retrieved their personal belongings and changed out of costume, rather than directly from the parade's endpoint. Either plan works — the key is deciding in advance and communicating it clearly to your chauffeur, rather than trying to improvise once you're back in cell-phone range after hours on a float.</p>

