    title: "Destination Wedding Guest Shuttles: Coordinating French Quarter Hotel Blocks in New Orleans",
    metaTitle: "Destination Wedding Guest Shuttle Guide | MSY Limo",
    metaDescription:
      "Planning guest transportation for a New Orleans destination wedding? Here's how to coordinate shuttle service across multiple French Quarter hotel room blocks.",
    category: "Weddings",
    author: "MSY Limo Team",
